{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Brave New World of the Internet"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Virtual Reality"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "  Accurately use information about common technology in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le10ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Questions within Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like  <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense</span>?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you explain how users will get involved in the process? (question with sentence)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you think that people will be able to afford the technology?  (asking for clarification)"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal  <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use  <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Verb Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  In the near future, everyone will be able to afford virtual reality.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  People are going to have experiences that they can't have in the real world</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  I'm developing a program like this next week. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  Pilot programs are set to begin next year. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "virtual reality"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a computer-generated simulation of real life that a user can interact with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With Virtual Reality, you're going to have experiences you can't have in the real world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about new technologies."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " not real; imaginary"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Virtual Reality will feel so real that people won't realize it's fake."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "headset"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "set of headphones and special goggles with a microphone attached to use with computer programs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You'll put on a headset and find yourself in another world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "expert"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person who is very knowledgeable about a subject"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Computer experts predict that Virtual Reality will take over television"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "educational"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "intended to educate and enlighten"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are important educational possibilities with Virtual Reality."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "equipment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "necessary items for a particular purpose; technology "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Computer companies will give free equipment to people who subscribe to Virtual Reality services. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alternate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " different; taking the place of something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With Virtual Reality, you will find yourself in an alternate world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pilot program"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used as an experiment or test"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Pilot programs are set to begin next year. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le10ob01aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask 8 people you know about their opinion on new technologies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them if they like to use new technologies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask what new technologies they may use in the future and how their lives may change. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the results in the chart below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your answers with your partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Use?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"c